{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1536842-looking-for-a-book-i-m-blanking","id":1536842,"title":"Looking for a book. I'm blanking.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-05T12:04:33-07:00","id":1536842,"title":"Looking for a book. I'm blanking.","content":"Since I collect Tremere things, (I swear I'm a Tremere in a Malkavian's body.) I'm looking for a book that deals with the aftermath, when the Tremere Antitribu were found as ash pillars, but can't remember for the un-life of me what book that came from. Was that Mexico City By Night?<br /> <br /> Please refresh my memory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18963-chris313allnight","name":"Chris313AllNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-05T14:50:27-07:00","id":1536847,"title":"","content":"Transylvania Chronicles IV or Nights of Prophecy if I remember correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-05T15:12:16-07:00","id":1536852,"title":"","content":"I think that the introduction of Nights of Prophecy addressed what happened and explains the effects on the metaplot. But I do not own that book so I cannot be sure.<br /> <br /> This plot is addressed in Transylvania Chronicles IV, but in another of those scenes that the PCs witness but cannot interfere with. But that doesn't really deal with the aftermath so I don't think that book is what the OP is looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-05T22:10:00-07:00","id":1536860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1536842-looking-for-a-book-i-m-blanking?p=1536852#post1536852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that the introduction of Nights of Prophecy addressed what happened and explains the effects on the metaplot. But I do not own that book so I cannot be sure.<br /> <br /> This plot is addressed in Transylvania Chronicles IV, but in another of those scenes that the PCs witness but cannot interfere with. But that doesn't really deal with the aftermath so I don't think that book is what the OP is looking for.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I appreciate the point to those 2 books, I had them for the Tremere bits, but it's been a while. I agree with you, I don't think that was the book I'm looking for. If I remember right, someone has come to the Tremere Antitribu chantry, finds statues of ash and an alligator in the vestibule. Don't know what book that's in or if that's right. But that's what pops up. <br /> <br /> Thanks to all who helped me build my collection. My ultimate goal is collect all WoD or CoD books that interest me. DTRPG is a huge blessing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18963-chris313allnight","name":"Chris313AllNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T02:59:41-07:00","id":1536885,"title":"","content":"<i>Beckett's Jyhad Diary</i> has him visiting the temple to pilfer Goratrix' library, but I don't remember the alligator.<br /> <br /> I just checked <i>Mexico City by Night</i> and it referenced that <i>Guide to the Sabbat</i> mentions an albino alligator, but I can't find my copy at the moment to verify.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T09:51:29-07:00","id":1536892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1536842-looking-for-a-book-i-m-blanking?p=1536885#post1536885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Beckett's Jyhad Diary</i> has him visiting the temple to pilfer Goratrix' library, but I don't remember the alligator.<br /> <br /> I just checked <i>Mexico City by Night</i> and it referenced that <i>Guide to the Sabbat</i> mentions an albino alligator, but I can't find my copy at the moment to verify.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I have BJD too. Gotta love Beckett breaking into places in search of lore. Guide to the Sabbat may be it. I don't have that one yet. So if you find out that's it, please post here. Thanks all!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18963-chris313allnight","name":"Chris313AllNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}